    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "description": "Events the agent never saw. `ring buffer` is the kernel to userspace ring buffer overflowing because the agent does not read fast enough; `bpf` is the kernel failing to submit an event at all.",
